Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What if a single queen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.97,0:00:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,could birth an entire city?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside an ant colony, millions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of tiny workers cooperate like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a living superorganism.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The colony revolves around one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,or more egg‑laying queens, whose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,sole purpose is to lay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,thousands of eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,From each egg emerges a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,larva, then a pupa, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,finally an adult whose destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,is decided by its nutrition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Most adults become sterile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,females—workers that tend brood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,forage, and defend the nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,while some develop into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,larger soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At the right season, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,queen also raises winged males
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and virgin females, called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,alates, that gather in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,massive swarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These nuptial flights happen at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,species‑specific times of day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and the alates leave the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,nest in search of mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Males die soon after mating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and most females also perish,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but a few fertilized queens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,shed their wings and descend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to start new colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:00:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The new queen digs a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,small chamber, lays her first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,eggs, and the cycle begins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,anew, linking countless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,generations beneath the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,From a single egg to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,a sprawling underground
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,metropolis, the ant colony
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,reminds us that cooperation can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,build worlds.